香囊，安患之，而不欲傷其意，因戲賭取，即焚之，於此遂止。"}],"interpretation_note":"按具名原文及本段語境保存，不補生母、未名共同祖先或絕對排行。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null},{"id":"a-jinshu079-xie-007","subject_person_id":"aa6_83c_juy_AA","predicate":"paternal_uncle","object_person_id":"aa6_83c_juy_B","status":"source_attested","qualifiers":{"source_term":"叔父","lineage":"paternal"},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-079","source_id":"s-jinshu-079-xielang-family","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-079-xielang-family","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-079-xielang-family:p003","quote":"朗字長度。父據，早卒。朗善言玄理，文義豔發，名亞于玄。總角時，病新起，體甚贏，未堪勞，于叔父安前與沙門支遁朗論，遂至相苦。其母王氏再遣信令還，安欲留，使竟論，王氏因出云：「新婦少遭艱難，一生所寄惟在此兒。」遂流涕攜朗去。安謂坐客曰：「家嫂辭情慷慨，恨不使朝士見之。」朗終於東陽太守。"}],"interpretation_note":"按具名原文及本段語境保存，不補生母、未名共同祖先或絕對排行。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null}],"family_tree_policy":{"default":"editorial_preferred","original_assertions_preserved":true,"unreviewed_conflicts_may_remain":true,"runtime_ai_required":false},"family_paths":[],"name_components":[{"person_id":"aa6_83c_juy_B","title":null,"surname":"謝","ming":"安","additional_names":[],"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-079","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-079-xielang-family","source_id":"s-jinshu-079-xielang-family","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-079-xielang-family:p001","quote":"謝安，字安石，尚從弟也。父裒，太常卿。安年四歲時，譙郡桓彝見而歎曰：「此兒風神秀徹，後當不減王東海。」及總角，神識沈敏，風宇條暢，善行書。弱冠，詣王蒙，清言良久，既去，蒙子修曰：「向客何如大人？」蒙曰：「此客亹亹，為來逼人。」王導亦深器之。由是少有重名。","note":"按正文具名傳主及親屬語境分姓名；字與名分開，未知日期、世系或稱號不補。胡之為完整雙字名，不將之誤拆為屬格。","status":"editorial_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"model":null,"zi":"安石"}],"mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-065-wangdao-family:p004:m0005","start":5,"end":7,"surface":"謝安","kind":"person","person_id":"aa6_83c_juy_B","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-065-wangdao-family:p004","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-065-wangdao-family"},{"id":"c-jinshu-065-wangdao-family:p004:m0013","start":13,"end":14,"surface":"安","kind":"person","person_id":"aa6_83c_juy_B","status":"contextual_provisional","